  <h2>Build a useful store exchange</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-game data-success-message="Correct. Each complete phrase now performs the stated price, size, fit, or decision purpose.">
    <h3>Drill 3: match each phrase to its purpose</h3>
    <p class="tile-target">Tap a complete phrase, then tap the situation it handles.</p>
    <div class="tile-bank">
      <button class="tile" data-tile="price one">How much is it?</button><button class="tile" data-tile="price plural">How much are they?</button><button class="tile" data-tile="size one">Do you have this in a medium?</button><button class="tile" data-tile="fit plural">They’re too big.</button><button class="tile" data-tile="decline one">I’ll think about it, thanks.</button>
    </div>
    <div class="slot-board">
