  <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="for" data-hint="The sign promises a lower price, so the needed preposition is on." data-fix="The boots are on sale, so they cost $30 instead of $50." data-why="On sale usually means discounted in U.S. shopping English. For sale only means available to buy." data-success-message="Correct. You changed availability for purchase to the intended discount meaning.">
