    <p>Then explain the difference between <span class="ex">wear</span> and <span class="ex">put on</span>, between <span class="ex">size</span> and <span class="ex">fit</span>, and between <span class="ex">on sale</span> and <span class="ex">for sale</span>.</p>
  </div>

