      <h3>Thirty-second retrieval</h3>
      <p>Without looking back, say one complete chain for a jacket and one for jeans. Then contrast <span class="ex">wear / put on</span>, <span class="ex">size / fit</span>, and <span class="ex">on sale / for sale</span>.</p>
