      <p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>This jacket is blue. Can I try it on? These jeans are blue. Can I try them on? Wear is a state; put on is an action. Size is a label; fit is how the item works on a body. On sale means discounted; for sale means available to buy.</strong></p>
